    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mc Peake Auctioneers are delighted to bring this fine three-bedroom semi- detached property to the market. Balkhill Park is a quiet well established estate and is conveniently located close to all local amenities including schools, Howth Village, shops, restaurants, cafes.  The area is well serviced by Dublin bus with rail services nearby at Howth dart stations. \r\nThe bright and well-appointed accommodation spans a generous 103.75 sqm/1,116 Sq. Ft. and comprises of entrance hall, with under stairs storage, good sized bright living room with fireplace and open fire, to the rear of the property there is a fully fitted kitchen cum dining area with patio doors leading to a very large split level south facing garden, there is also a large utility room leading off the hallway which provides access to the front and the rear of the property.  The upstairs accommodation has three double bedrooms with the main bedroom providing sea views. There is a good sized family bathroom with separate shower, wc & whb. \r\nThe rear garden is south facing and positioned on a split level, with expansive decking area that steps up to good sized lawn and purpose built block shed.with the opportunity to transform this space into an office or playroom, or extra accommodation.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThere is off street parking to the front, with potential to extend the driveway.\r\nBalkill Park is a well-established estate close to a countless range of local amenities, including schools, shops, cafés, and parks. It’s well connected, with nearby bus routes, the DART line offering quick and easy access to Dublin City Centre, and convenient links to major roads. The location is especially attractive, with scenic walks that stretches to Howth Summit and down into Howth Village."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall – (4.00m x 0.95m) Solid wooden flooring, under stairs storage\r\nLiving Room – (3.49m x 5.16m) Solid wooden flooring, feature fireplace\r\nUtility Room – (2.34m x 5.16m) fully fitted kitchen storage with sink, access to front and rear garden \r\nKitchen/Dining – (5.43 x 3.58m) half tiled flooring/ half wooden oak flooring, fully fitted high gloss kitchen, dishwasher, electric hob, integrated oven, extractor fan,  patio doors leading to south facing rear garden\r\nStairs – Carpeted\r\nLanding – (2.85m x 1.44m) Solid wood oak flooring, access to attic\r\nBathroom – (1.95m x 2.48m) Fully tiled floor to ceiling, free standing shower, whb , wc \r\nMain Bedroom – (3.48m x 3.14m) Solid wood flooring, fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 2 – (2.66m x 3.61m) Solid wood flooring, fitted wardrobes\r\nBedroom 3 – (2.73m x 3.63m) Solid wood flooring"
      },
      {
